---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Gestión de convocatoria">
  <main class="recruitment-admin">
    <section id="recruitment-login" class="login-panel panel" aria-live="polite">
      <p class="eyebrow">UNICODE · GTH</p>
      <h1>Gestión de <span class="title-accent">convocatoria</span></h1>
      <p id="recruitment-login-message" class="muted">Abriendo el inicio de sesión…</p>
      <a class="nav-back" href="/admin?volver=gth">Iniciar sesión</a>
    </section>

    <div id="recruitment-dashboard" hidden>
      <header class="admin-header">
        <div>
          <a class="nav-back" href="/admin"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>Volver a postulaciones</a>
          <p class="eyebrow">UNICODE · GTH</p>
          <h1>Gestión de <span class="title-accent">convocatoria</span></h1>
          <p class="muted">Configuración, seguimiento y comunicaciones.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="header-actions">
          <div id="recruitment-countdown" class="recruitment-countdown" hidden></div>
          <button id="recruitment-logout" class="secondary">Cerrar sesión</button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <p id="admin-message" class="message" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
      <nav class="admin-nav" aria-label="Secciones de gestión">
        <button type="button" data-panel="configuration" aria-current="page">Configuración</button>
        <button type="button" data-panel="applications">Postulaciones <span id="application-count" class="count">0</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-panel="communications">Comunicaciones</button>
        <button type="button" data-panel="access">Accesos</button>
      </nav>

      <section id="panel-configuration" aria-labelledby="config-title">
        <form id="recruitment-config-form" class="stack">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div><h2 id="config-title">Convocatoria</h2><p class="muted">Las fechas se guardan en horario de Lima (UTC−5).</p></div>
            <span id="config-state" class="badge">Cargando…</span>
          </div>
          <section class="status-card" aria-labelledby="status-title"><h3 id="status-title" class="sr-only">Estado de las conexiones</h3><ul id="connection-status" class="status-list"></ul></section>
          <fieldset class="panel">
            <legend>Publicación y plazos</legend>
            <div class="field-grid">
              <label class="wide">Nombre de convocatoria<input name="title" maxlength="120" required /></label>
              <label>Apertura<input name="opensAt" type="datetime-local" /></label>
              <label>Cierre<input name="closesAt" type="datetime-local" /></label>
              <label>Prórroga <span class="optional">Opcional</span><input name="extensionAt" type="datetime-local" /></label>
              <label>Recordar cada (horas)<input name="inactivityHours" type="number" min="1" max="720" step="1" required /><small>Mientras un borrador no avance, se le recuerda terminar cada este número de horas.</small></label>
            </div>
            <label class="check-line"><input name="enabled" type="checkbox" /> Habilitar convocatoria dentro del plazo configurado</label>
            <p class="muted note">Para abrir, configura fechas, al menos un área y dos preguntas activas por categoría.</p>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="panel">
            <legend>Áreas y cupos</legend>
            <p class="muted note">Los porcentajes se calculan sobre los cupos de las áreas habilitadas. Los cupos son una referencia: no limitan las inscripciones.</p>
            <div id="area-config" class="area-grid"></div>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="panel">
            <legend>Video de presentación</legend>
            <div class="field-grid">
              <label>Duración máxima<input type="text" value="3 min 30 s" disabled /></label>
              <label>Preguntas por categoría<input type="text" value="2 (4 preguntas en total)" disabled /></label>
              <label>Almacenamiento<select name="storageProvider"><option value="drive">Google Drive</option><option value="supabase">Supabase Storage</option></select><small>El cambio afecta a nuevas subidas; los videos anteriores conservan su proveedor.</small></label>
              <label>Preparación en segundos<input name="preparationSeconds" type="number" min="0" max="300" step="1" required /></label>
              <label>Tamaño máximo en MB<input name="maxVideoMB" type="number" min="1" max="50" step="1" required /></label>
            </div>
            <p class="muted note">Solo grabación en la web. Las preguntas aparecen al iniciar el intento; tras una falla técnica, el reintento trae preguntas nuevas.</p>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="panel">
            <legend>Rúbrica del video</legend>
            <p class="muted note">Define los descriptores de evaluación. Cada criterio tiene un máximo de 5 puntos; la calificación corresponde al módulo de evaluación.</p>
            <div id="video-rubric-config" class="stack"></div>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="panel">
            <legend>Criterios para integrar con la evaluación</legend>
            <p class="muted note">Estos valores quedan pendientes hasta que el equipo defina las escalas y la evaluación. Guardarlos no califica ni descarta automáticamente.</p>
            <div class="field-grid three">
              <label>Umbral de afinidad (%)<input name="thresholdAffinity" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" /></label>
              <label>Umbral escrito (%)<input name="thresholdWritten" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" /></label>
              <label>Umbral de video (0–15 puntos)<input name="thresholdVideo" type="number" min="0" max="15" step="0.01" /></label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="panel">
            <legend>Banco de preguntas</legend>
            <p class="muted note">Cada postulante recibe dos preguntas distintas de cada categoría. Editar el banco afecta solo a nuevas asignaciones.</p>
            <div id="question-config" class="question-columns"></div>
          </fieldset>

          <div class="save-bar" id="config-save-bar">
            <p class="muted" id="config-save-info">Los cambios se aplican al guardar.</p>
            <button type="submit" class="primary" id="save-config">Guardar configuración</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </section>

      <section id="panel-access" aria-labelledby="access-title" hidden>
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div><h2 id="access-title">Accesos de directores</h2><p class="muted">Cada director entra a /admin con su correo y un código que le llega por correo. Todos ven las postulaciones de todas las áreas; solo los de GTH entran a este panel.</p></div>
        </div>
        <form id="director-add" class="panel director-add" novalidate>
          <h3>Agregar director</h3>
          <div class="director-add-grid">
            <label>Correo<input name="email" type="email" required maxlength="254" placeholder="nombre.apellido@uni.pe" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label>Nombre (opcional)<input name="name" maxlength="150" placeholder="Ej. Ana Quispe" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label>Área<select name="area" required></select></label>
            <button type="submit" class="primary">Agregar</button>
          </div>
          <p id="directors-status" class="muted" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
        <section class="panel director-panel" aria-labelledby="directors-count">
          <div class="director-panel-head"><h3 id="directors-count">Directores con acceso</h3><p class="muted">Cada cambio se guarda al momento.</p></div>
          <ul id="directors-list" class="director-list"></ul>
        </section>
      </section>

      <section id="panel-applications" aria-labelledby="applications-title" hidden>
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div><h2 id="applications-title">Postulaciones</h2><p class="muted">Datos, preguntas, video y cambios de estado.</p></div>
          <button id="refresh-applications" type="button" class="secondary">Actualizar</button>
        </div>
        <details class="panel preview-panel">
          <summary><span>Modo de prueba</span><svg class="preview-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg></summary>
          <div class="stack compact preview-content">
            <p class="muted">Genera un enlace secreto para que el equipo postule en la web publicada aunque la convocatoria esté cerrada al público. Esas postulaciones aparecen como «Prueba» y se borran con sus videos cuando termines.</p>
            <p id="preview-state" class="muted" role="status"></p>
            <div class="button-row"><button id="preview-create" type="button" class="primary">Generar enlace de prueba</button><button id="preview-disable" type="button" class="secondary">Desactivar enlace</button><button id="purge-tests" type="button" class="secondary">Borrar postulaciones de prueba</button></div>
            <label id="preview-link-box" hidden>Enlace de prueba: cópialo ahora, no se volverá a mostrar<input id="preview-link" readonly /></label>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="panel preview-panel status-guide-panel">
          <summary><span>Guía y significado de estados</span><svg class="preview-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg></summary>
          <div class="preview-content status-guide-content">
            <p class="muted">El proceso es flexible: se puede avanzar por etapas o definir la decisión directamente sin pasar obligatoriamente por una 2.ª etapa. <strong>Cada director decide sobre los postulantes de su propia área</strong> (1.ª o 2.ª opción), mientras que los directores de <strong>GTH y administración general pueden decidir sobre todas las áreas</strong>.</p>
            <div class="status-guide-grid">
              <div class="status-guide-card">
                <h4>1.ª Etapa · Revisión inicial o directa</h4>
                <ul>
                  <li><span class="badge status-submitted">Inscripción completa</span> Formulario y video enviados. Pendiente de decisión del equipo.</li>
                  <li><span class="badge status-profile_validated">Avanza a la 2.ª etapa</span> Perfil aprobado. Pasa a evaluación final o entrevista.</li>
                  <li><span class="badge status-profile_rejected">No avanza</span> No superó la revisión de la 1.ª etapa. Recibe correo de cierre.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="status-guide-card">
                <h4>Decisión final (2.ª etapa o directa)</h4>
                <ul>
                  <li><span class="badge status-selected">Ingresa a UNICODE</span> Postulante seleccionado/a definitivamente (tras 2.ª etapa o por decisión directa).</li>
                  <li><span class="badge status-not_selected">No ingresa</span> No seleccionado/a en el resultado final (o decisión directa de no ingreso).</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="status-guide-card">
                <h4>Borradores y gestión</h4>
                <ul>
                  <li><span class="badge status-draft">Borrador</span> En edición por el postulante (aún sin enviar).</li>
                  <li><span class="badge status-incomplete">Incompleto</span> Borrador inactivo con recordatorios por correo.</li>
                  <li><span class="badge status-expired">Plazo vencido</span> No llegó a enviarse antes del cierre de convocatoria.</li>
                  <li><span class="badge status-withdrawn">Retirado</span> Postulación cancelada o retirada a solicitud del postulante.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <div class="filters panel">
          <label>Estado<select id="filter-status"><option value="">Todos los estados</option></select></label>
          <label>Área<select id="filter-area"><option value="">Todas las áreas</option></select></label>
          <label class="search-field">Buscar por nombre o correo<input id="filter-search" type="search" placeholder="Nombre o correo" /></label>
        </div>
        <ul class="status-legend" aria-label="Colores de estado">
          <li><span class="badge status status-progress">En proceso</span></li>
          <li><span class="badge status status-complete">Inscripción completa</span></li>
          <li><span class="badge status status-advanced">Avanza a la 2.ª etapa</span></li>
          <li><span class="badge status status-joined">Ingresa</span></li>
          <li><span class="badge status status-negative">No avanza / No ingresa</span></li>
          <li><span class="badge status status-inactive">Vencido o retirado</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p id="applications-info" class="muted" role="status"></p>
        <div id="applications-list" class="app-list"></div>
        <dialog id="application-detail" class="detail-panel" aria-labelledby="detail-title">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div><p class="eyebrow">Detalle de postulación</p><h2 id="detail-title"></h2></div>
            <button id="close-detail" type="button" class="secondary">Cerrar</button>
          </div>
          <div id="detail-personal" class="detail-grid"></div>
          <div id="detail-answers" class="stack compact"></div>
          <h3>Preguntas asignadas</h3>
          <div id="detail-questions" class="question-columns"></div>
          <div class="video-summary">
            <div><h3>Video</h3><p id="detail-video-info" class="muted"></p></div>
            <button id="open-video" type="button" class="secondary" hidden>Ver video aquí</button>
          </div>
          <p id="video-access-message" class="muted" role="status" hidden></p>
          <div id="inline-video" hidden>
            <div class="button-row">
              <button id="resize-video" type="button" class="secondary" aria-pressed="false">Ampliar reproductor</button>
              <a id="video-new-tab" class="back-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Abrir en otra pestaña</a>
            </div>
            <div id="video-frame" class="video-frame"></div>
          </div>
          <section class="transition-box" aria-labelledby="stage-title">
            <h3 id="stage-title">Resultado</h3>
            <p id="stage-hint" class="muted note"></p>
            <div id="stage-buttons" class="button-row"></div>
          </section>
          <h3>Historial</h3>
          <ol id="detail-history" class="history"></ol>
          <section class="danger-zone" aria-labelledby="delete-title">
            <div><h3 id="delete-title">Eliminar postulación</h3><p class="muted">Para pruebas o envíos por error. Borra los datos, el historial y el video. No se puede deshacer.</p></div>
            <button id="delete-application" type="button" class="danger-button">Eliminar</button>
          </section>
        </dialog>
      </section>

      <section id="panel-communications" aria-labelledby="communications-title" hidden>
        <div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="communications-title">Comunicaciones</h2><p class="muted">Plantillas y estado de envío de correos.</p></div></div>
        <section class="panel stack" aria-labelledby="queue-title">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div><h3 id="queue-title">Cola de correos</h3><p class="muted note">Los reintentos conservan la misma solicitud de correo.</p></div>
            <div class="button-row"><button id="refresh-emails" type="button" class="secondary">Actualizar</button><button id="remind-all" type="button" class="secondary">Recordar a todos ahora</button><button id="process-emails" type="button" class="primary">Procesar pendientes</button></div>
          </div>
          <div id="email-summary" class="stats"></div>
          <div id="email-list" class="email-list"></div>
          <button id="email-more" type="button" class="link-more" hidden></button>
          <p id="email-process-result" class="muted" role="status" hidden></p>
        </section>
        <form id="templates-form" class="stack">
          <div><h3>Plantillas</h3><p class="muted note">Texto plano. Variables permitidas: <span id="template-variables"></span></p></div>
          <div id="template-list" class="template-list"></div>
          <details id="disabled-templates" class="disabled-templates" hidden><summary></summary><div id="disabled-template-list" class="template-list"></div></details>
          <div class="save-bar" id="templates-save-bar"><p class="muted" id="templates-save-info">Los cambios se aplican al guardar.</p><button type="submit" class="primary">Guardar plantillas</button></div>
        </form>
      </section>
    </div>
    <noscript><p class="message">Activa JavaScript para acceder a la gestión de convocatoria.</p></noscript>
  </main>
</Layout>

<script>
  import "../../scripts/recruitment-admin";
</script>

<style is:global>
  .recruitment-admin ~ footer { display: none; }
  .recruitment-admin { --admin-green: #75d32d; --admin-border: #27272a; --admin-muted: #b4b4bd; --admin-motion: 160ms; width: min(1160px, 100%); min-width: 0; margin-inline: auto; padding: 32px 24px 72px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .recruitment-admin *, .recruitment-admin *::before, .recruitment-admin *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .recruitment-admin [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  .recruitment-admin .login-panel { max-width: 500px; margin: max(40px, 12vh) auto; }
  .recruitment-admin .login-panel .stack { margin-top: 24px; }
  .recruitment-admin h1 { font-size: clamp(28px, 3.1vw, 36px); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: -.035em; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .recruitment-admin h2 { font-size: 23px; font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.35; letter-spacing: -.02em; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .recruitment-admin h3 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .recruitment-admin .title-accent { color: var(--admin-green); }
  .recruitment-admin p { line-height: 1.65; }
  .recruitment-admin .muted { color: var(--admin-muted); font-size: 14px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .recruitment-admin .eyebrow { color: var(--admin-green); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .1em; margin: 16px 0 8px; }
  .recruitment-admin .nav-back { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; min-height: 40px; padding: 8px 16px 8px 11px; border: 1px solid var(--admin-border); border-radius: 999px; background: #0d0d10; color: #d4d4d8; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
  .recruitment-admin .nav-back:hover { border-color: #52525b; background: #18181b; color: #fff; }
  .recruitment-admin .login-panel .nav-back { margin-top: 20px; padding-left: 16px; }
  .recruitment-admin .admin-header, .recruitment-admin .section-heading, .recruitment-admin .save-bar, .recruitment-admin .video-summary { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 18px; }
  .recruitment-admin .admin-header { margin-bottom: 28px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .recruitment-admin .admin-header > div, .recruitment-admin .section-heading > div, .recruitment-admin .video-summary > div { min-width: 0; }
  .recruitment-admin .video-frame { height: 360px; min-height: 200px; max-height: 85vh; resize: vertical; overflow: auto; background: #080808; margin-top: 12px; border-radius: 12px; }
  .recruitment-admin .video-frame.expanded { height: 650px; }
  .recruitment-admin .video-frame :global(iframe), .recruitment-admin .video-frame :global(video) { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0; object-fit: contain; }
  .recruitment-admin .admin-header .muted { margin-top: 8px; }
  .recruitment-admin .admin-header > button { margin-top: 16px; }
  .recruitment-admin .section-heading { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .recruitment-admin .section-heading .muted { margin-top: 6px; }
  .recruitment-admin .stack { display: grid; gap: 28px; min-width: 0; }
  .recruitment-admin .compact { gap: 16px; }
  .recruitment-admin .panel { background: #111113; border: 1px solid var(--admin-border); border-radius: 18px; padding: 26px; min-width: 0; }
  .recruitment-admin fieldset { margin: 0; }
  .recruitment-admin legend { max-width: 100%; color: #fff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; padding: 0 8px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .recruitment-admin label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; gap: 9px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #e4e4e7; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .recruitment-admin input:not([type="checkbox"]), .recruitment-admin select, .recruitment-admin textarea { width: 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 46px; background: #09090b; border: 1px solid #3f3f46; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 13px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #fff; color-scheme: dark; transition: border-color var(--admin-motion), box-shadow var(--admin-motion); }
  .recruitment-admin :is(input:not([type="checkbox"]), select, textarea):hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: #60606b; }
  .recruitment-admin textarea { min-height: 118px; resize: vertical; line-height: 1.65; }
  .recruitment-admin :is(input, textarea)::placeholder { color: #858590; opacity: 1; }
  .recruitment-admin input:disabled { color: var(--admin-muted); opacity: .85; }
  .recruitment-admin small, .recruitment-admin .optional { color: var(--admin-muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .recruitment-admin .optional { display: inline; }
  .recruitment-admin input[type="checkbox"] { width: 20px; height: 20px; accent-color: var(--admin-green); flex-shrink: 0; cursor: pointer; }
  .recruitment-admin .check-line { flex-direction: row; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; gap: 11px; margin-top: 18px; padding-block: 6px; cursor: pointer; }
  .recruitment-admin .field-grid, .recruitment-admin .question-columns, .recruitment-admin .detail-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
  .recruitment-admin .field-grid.three { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .recruitment-admin .wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .recruitment-admin .note { margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .recruitment-admin .check-line + .note { margin: 14px 0 0; }
  .recruitment-admin button, .recruitment-admin a { -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; transition: background var(--admin-motion), border-color var(--admin-motion), color var(--admin-motion), box-shadow var(--admin-motion); }
  .recruitment-admin button { cursor: pointer; touch-action: manipulation; }
  .recruitment-admin button:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: wait; }
  .recruitment-admin :is(button, a, input, select, textarea, summary):focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--admin-green); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .recruitment-admin .primary, .recruitment-admin .secondary { min-height: 44px; max-width: 100%; border-radius: 999px; padding: 11px 18px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5; text-align: center; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .recruitment-admin .primary { background: var(--admin-green); color: #0a0a0a; border: 1px solid var(--admin-green); }
  .recruitment-admin .primary:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #94e65a; }
  .recruitment-admin .secondary { border: 1px solid #3f3f46; color: #e4e4e7; background: #18181b; }
  .recruitment-admin .secondary:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: #71717a; background: #27272a; }
  .recruitment-admin .message { padding: 14px 17px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #3f3f46; border-left: 3px solid var(--admin-green); background: #18181b; color: #f4f4f5; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 16px 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .recruitment-admin .message.error { border-color: #7f1d1d; border-left-color: #f87171; background: #1c1214; color: #fecaca; }
  .recruitment-admin .admin-nav { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--admin-border); border-radius: 14px; margin: 0 0 30px; background: #0c0c0e; }
  .recruitment-admin .admin-nav button { min-width: 0; min-height: 46px; padding: 11px 10px; border-radius: 9px; color: var(--admin-muted); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .recruitment-admin .admin-nav button:hover { background: #19191d; color: #fff; }
  .recruitment-admin .admin-nav button[aria-current="page"] { color: #fff; background: #27272a; box-shadow: inset 0 -2px 0 var(--admin-green); }
  .recruitment-admin .admin-nav button[aria-current="page"] .count { color: var(--admin-green); }
  .recruitment-admin .count { display: inline-block; margin-left: 4px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
